@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Courier

title Error interrupt status register (ERRORINTRSTS)\nOffset: 0x0032 | Access: Read/Write

map Register {
  15 => ERRORINTRSTS_CMDTIMEOUTERROR
  14 => ERRORINTRSTS_CMDCRCERROR
  13 => ERRORINTRSTS_CMDENDBITERROR
  12 => ERRORINTRSTS_CMDINDEXERROR
  11 => ERRORINTRSTS_DATATIMEOUTERROR
  10 => ERRORINTRSTS_DATACRCERROR
  9 => ERRORINTRSTS_DATAENDBITERROR
  8 => 0
  7 => ERRORINTRSTS_AUTOCMDERROR
  6 => ERRORINTRSTS_ADMAERROR
  5 => 0
  4 => 0
  3 => ERRORINTRSTS_HOSTERROR
  2 => 0
  1 => 0
  0 => 0
}

note bottom
  R (Read): Bits 0-2=0, Bit 3=ERRORINTRSTS_HOSTERROR, Bits 4-5=0,
            Bit 6=ERRORINTRSTS_ADMAERROR, Bit 7=ERRORINTRSTS_AUTOCMDERROR,
            Bit 8=0, Bits 9-15=various error status bits
  W (Write): Bit 3=w1c, Bits 6-7=w1c, Bits 9-15=w1c
  Reset: All bits = 0
end note

@enduml